# Helm — migrations are NOT ignored in this fork. Upstream's cd.yml copies
# api/migrations/ into the chart at deploy time, which works for a pipeline that
# runs `helm upgrade` from a checkout. This fork is deployed by Argo CD reading
# helm/glyph straight out of git, and Argo has no such step — an ignored
# migrations/ renders an EMPTY migrations ConfigMap, the run-migrations init
# container applies nothing, and the API comes up against an empty schema.
# scripts/sync-migrations.sh regenerates the copy; CI fails on drift.

